### 21 §

> _Har upphävts genom [lag (2014:591)](https://rkrattsbaser.gov.se/sfst?bet=2014%3A591)._

### 22 §

> _Har upphävts genom [lag (2014:591)](https://rkrattsbaser.gov.se/sfst?bet=2014%3A591)._
